"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the whole.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the missing picture is as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-05ada366ae2fb463539e7802de9cd09b\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/05ada366ae2fb463539e7802de9cd09b\"></div></div></div>",
